<title>FRANCE: Kleinwort places stakes in AXA-UAP, AGF.</title>
<headline>Kleinwort places stakes in AXA-UAP, AGF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said it had placed 437,175 shares, or 0.13 percent, in insurer AXA-UAP and 3,033,898 shares or 2.22 percent in other insurer AGF.</p>
<p>Kleinwort said the placings were oversubsribed. It bought the shares on July 17 from France Telecom.  </p>
<p>Kleinwort had no comment on the price of the placements.</p>
<p>Xavier Rollet, head of global equity risk and trading, said the placement was completed on Thursday.</p>
</text>
